$ Python library: huggingface_hub
@ huggingface_hub

code {
pip install --upgrade huggingface_hub
code }

{ Command line utility hf

  With `huggingface_hub`, the command line utility `hf` is also installed.

  { hf auth login

  `hf auth login` allows to specify the hugging face token either by logging in on hugging face's website or by pasting the token.

   The token starts with `hf_` and will be stored under `→ Linux/fhs/home/username/_cache/huggingface/token` and/or `→ Linux/fhs/home/username/_cache/huggingface/stored_tokens`

  }
  { hf download

code {
hf download HuggingFaceH4/zephyr-7b-beta
code }

    The model(s) are downloaded to subdirectories in `→ Linux/fhs/home/username/_cache/huggingface/hub`.
 
    Compare with `huggingface_hub.hf_hub_download()`.

  }

}
